Welcome to Gopher Queue service

This service provide availability to manage and scheduling tasks inline your architecture.

Functionality:
REST API to queue your task with JSON payload
Start notBefore, retries, backoff.
Working delivery (long‑polling), ack/fail и DLQ (dead‑letter).
In‑memory backend, concurrent-safe.
Graceful-shutdown, healthz, readiness.
Metrics Prometheus (tasks count, duration).